    "description": "<p>Acquired with CR 11 or higher. &laquo;Frost Spear&raquo; and &laquo;Frigid Wind&raquo; ignore &nbsp;[Cancel: Cold] status on targets.</p>\n<p>(SR2): \"Freezing Liner\" [Hate] cost is reduced by -1 (minimum 0).</p>\n<hr>\n<p>You are a sorcerer who specializes in magic that manipulates cold air. Even the beasts that can endure the extreme cold will stop helplessly in the face of the true cold you bring.</p>",
